019%2018%2019%2016%2028%2024%2017%2018%2017%2020%208%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"ScaleSolo\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:9px;\">\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align:middle;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">ScaleSolo</td>\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 36px 8px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e7e5ea;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:21px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Help me make this sound like you</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">To build a brand that actually feels like yours, I need a little from you. Just reply to this email with your answers, plain text is perfect.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">1. Who is this brand for. Describe your dream follower in one or two sentences.<br>\n2. What are three words that describe how your brand should talk.<br>\n3. What do you want people to feel when they land on your page.<br>\n4. Any brands or creators whose vibe you love. Drop a couple of names.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">That is it. The more honest you are here, the more it will sound like <span style=\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700;\">you</span> and not a template. This is the part that makes a faceless brand feel human.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">Talk soon,<br>Rayvaughn<br><span style=\"color:#86838f;\">Founder, Vernon Tech &amp; Media</span></p>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:18px 36px 30px;border-top:1px solid #221f29;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#86838f;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;\">\n        You are getting this because you joined ScaleSolo through Rayvaughn at Vernon Tech &amp; Media.<br>\n        Just reply if you ever want to reach me directly.<br>\n        <a href=\"https://scalesolo.ai\" style=\"color:#ef4444;text-decoration:none;\">scalesolo.ai</a>\n        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"{$unsubscribe}\" style=\"color:#86838f;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
